Quiet skin for Roundcube Webmail
================================

This folder (skins/quiet) is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Quiet is an adaptation of Elastic, the default skin of Roundcube Webmail
(Copyright (c) The Roundcube Dev Team), which is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0.
Quiet's templates are modified copies of Elastic's, and the compiled
styles/*.min.css files contain Elastic's compiled stylesheets, so the
ShareAlike terms of Elastic's licence apply to this folder as a whole.

Changes: Quiet replaces Elastic's colours, typography, icons and several
templates (login, mail, message, compose, layout, menu) and adds colour
schemes and a dark-mode palette. See README.md for details.

Third-party material in this folder, under its own licence:

- IBM Plex Sans (fonts/*.woff2), Copyright 2019 IBM Corp.,
  SIL Open Font License 1.1: see fonts/OFL.txt
- Lucide icons (embedded as SVG data in styles/quiet/_glyphs.less and the
  compiled styles/*.min.css), ISC License: see LICENSE-lucide.txt

Everything outside this folder (dev stack, tests, tooling, docs) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0: see LICENSE in the
repository root.
